                                                                    TILE_CHANGE
            0x1405001e1 sub_140500110                  0x1800       GOT_PUNCHED|TILE_CHANGE
            0x1405006b6 HandleTileActionResult         0x400000     POWER_UP_PUNCH_START
            0x1405006ca HandleTileActionResult         0xa00        PUNCH|TILE_CHANGE
            0x1405008fc NetAvatar::OnPunched           0x1800       GOT_PUNCHED|TILE_CHANGE
            0x140500a83 sub_140500A70                  0x2800       RESPAWN|TILE_CHANGE
