            0x1405066de TryPlaceSeedAtTile             0x80         JUMP
            0x14050cba0 applyTankStateAndEvents        0xc00        re-broadcast PLACE
            0x14050cc3b applyTankStateAndEvents        0x2800       re-broadcast RESPAWN
            0x140510857 integrateVerticalAxis          0x40000      PARASOL (slow-fall A)
            0x1405108eb integrateVerticalAxis          0x40000      PARASOL
